<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls one point to 851.3 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls one point to 851.3 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell one point on Wednesday to 851.3, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the trade index losing the most, down 9.8 points, or 3.20 percent, to 296.1 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
